with that exact producer role and archetype may checkpoint or integrate it. The orchestrator routes that run; it does not close the leaf, and no orchestrator run may execute the integration itself. `done` is produced only by the integration transaction, never by you and never by an acknowledgement. Never supply `commit_ack` yourself.\n\nChanges requested and Stop-The-Line are unchanged: route to `to-dev`/`analysis` or evidence-backed `blocked`. Leaving the element in `reviewing` is still not a verdict and still gets this run cancelled and respawned.\n"}}
