Sync twice; inject a crash after write before sync yourself and confirm Load refuses/ignores the torn record; identical inputs replay byte-identical bytes with no second write (assert inode set). (5) Refusal census and mutation — enumerate every refuse arm of smoke.go/matrix.go/record.go/store.go and the two provhost replay accessors (the producer claims zero refusal sites there — verify); each arm needs a named test reaching it through the production entry; rerun TestSmokeMutantsAreKilled twice (10 KILLED + control), plant at least four narrowing mutants of your own (cell letter compare admitting C as A for one provider; probe digest compare by prefix; confidence check admitting strong for one provider; record digest omit-self scope widened) plus an applied harmless SURVIVED control; per-plant raw logs, subprocess exits, precise denominators. (6) Story-close items — ownership registry bindings for 2.4 (4/4 full), 5.5 (1/3 sliver), 7.7 (3/4 partial), 8 (4/12 sliver), 12 new acceptance cases, reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 re-pinned: recompute the projection digest independently, confirm every claimed clause line exists in the pinned document and each binding names an existing production declaration driven by an acceptance case (plant a self-minted claim — refused), tracecheck 29/463 reproduced; README sections (sessprofile existed; native-resume smoke added) with test commands and no capability claim; LOGBOOK newest-first with all Story entries and trunk's 3lt2xv entry preserved. (7) Hygiene — changed_paths carry no __pycache__/.pyc/stray plants; gofmt/vet clean; go test ./internal/resumesmoke ./internal/provhost ./internal/sessprofile ./internal/traceability/... -count=1 and -race green; tracecheck and `cataloggen -adopted -output internal/catalog/catalog_gen.go -check` exit 0 on the exact tree; the native-Windows bind rows skip loudly on POSIX with the exact reason.\n4|\n5|Method: isolated immutable probes only, never mutate the live Story worktree, index, branch or HEAD; no product edits, commits, checkpoints or integration; Curator go-testing-tools skill; all CI local; PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 for every harness; keep scratch small under .temp/TASK-260830-2zvo8m/ and delete candidate copies when done. Attach TASK-260830-2zvo8m_review-verdict-rev1.md and TASK-260830-2zvo8m_review-evidence-rev1.tar.gz (a real gzip archive), complete the live merged checklist, then accept_cr(TASK-260830-2zvo8m, revision=1, evidence=TASK-260830-2zvo8m_review-verdict-rev1.md) or hand off changes requested with P1/P2/P3 classes named. Model: muse-spark xhigh (codex reviewers are out of quota until 2026-09-19). Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
