apability (no capability map, no doctor surface).\n29|\n30|## AC coverage: 16 of 16 rows driven through production entries\n31|\n32|| # | Behavior | Production call site | Named test |\n33||---|----------|----------------------|------------|\n34|| 1 | Exact-version probe check | `Run.probe` via `Host.Call(OpProbe)` + `ProbeBuild` | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts`, `TestSmokeProbeMismatchFails` |\n35|| 2 | Identify-session at exact confidence | `Run.identify` via `Host.Call(OpIdentifySession)` + `SplitIdentifyResult` | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts`, `TestSmokeStrongConfidenceFails` |\n36|| 3 | Discover/read over declared native roots | `Run.bind` via `StoreRootFor` + `VerifyIdentityDiscovery` | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts`, `TestSmokeCrossTupleProofFails` |\n37|| 4 | Resume plan over identity, workspaces, profile, terminal, lease | `Run.resume` via `ResolveMapping` + `Host.Call(OpResume)` + `DecodeSpawnPlan` | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts`, `TestSmokePiUnmappedVersionFails` |\n38|| 5 | Quiescence as read-only precondition input | `Run.quiescence` via `DecodeQuiesceProof` | `TestSmokeSafeQuiescencePasses`, `TestSmokeUnsafeQuiescenceFails` |\n39|| 6 | A-cell positives | `Run` + `ResumeCell` | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts` (A subtests) |\n40|| 7 | C-cell gated outcomes, never promoted | `Run.resume` cell gate | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts` (C subtests), `TestSmokePromotionAttemptRefuses` |\n41|| 8 | U-cell unsupported refusals, zero adapter calls | `Run` cell gate | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts` (qwen subtests) |\n42|| 9 | ?-cell unknown refusals, zero adapter calls | `Run` cell gate | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts` (future/muse-windows subtests), `TestSmokeMuseOnePatchOffPinRefuses` |\n43|| 10 | Probe/version mismatch fails closed | `Run.probe` drift arm | `TestSmokeProbeMismatchFails` |\n44|| 11 | Unbound discovery proof refuses | `Run.bind` | `TestSmokeCrossTupleProofFails` |\n45|| 12 | Non-A resume plan refuses | `Run.resume` cell arm | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts` (C subtests assert skipped + gated) |\n46|| 13 | Passing smoke advertises no capability | Record shape (closed, no capability surface) | `TestSmokeRecordCarriesNoCapabilityClaim` |\n47|| 14 | Appendix B gates (Muse pin, Antigravity realm) | `ResumeCell` + realm rule via `VerifyIdentityDiscovery` | `TestSmokeMuseOnePatchOffPinRefuses`, `TestSmokeAntigravityUnresolvedRealmFails` |\n48|| 15 | Durable evidence: no-replace + fsync, crash, byte-identical replay | `Store`/`Load` | `TestStoreDisagreementQuarantines`, `TestStoreRealKillBetweenWriteAndSync`, `TestSmokeIdenticalInputsReplayIdenticalBytes`, `TestStoreReplayIsIdentical` |\n49|| 16 | Tamper-evidence and verdict consistency | `VerifyRecord` | `TestSmokeTamperedRecordRefuses`, `TestSmokePromotionAttemptRefuses`, `TestSmokeInconsistentFailRefuses`, `TestSmokeWhitespaceVariantRefuses` |\n50|\n51|Row verdicts derive all 27 Section 8.4 rows from the pinned\n52|specification text (`TestResumeMatrixCoversEverySpecRow`), not from a\n53|hand-typed literal; `TestResumeMatrixAgreesWithTupleGate` pins\n54|matrix/gate agreement. One available row additionally runs end to end\n55|through a real provider child process\n56|(`TestSmokeThroughRealProviderProcess`, byte-identical to in-process).\n57|\n58|## Narrowing mutants: 10 killed, 1 SURVIVED control\n59|\n60|Committed harness `TestSmokeMutantsAreKilled`; each mutant runs in a\n61|private module copy, so the harness never touches the checkout.\n62|\n63|| Mutant (narrowing) | Killed by |\n64||---|---|\n65|| resume-gate-admits-conditional | `TestSmokeRowVerdicts/gemini-0.54.4-wsl2-amd64` |\n66|| probe-admits-version-drift | `TestSmokeProbeMismatchFails` |\n67|| identify-admits-strong | `TestSmokeStrongConfidenceFails` |\n68|| bind-admits-antigravity | `TestSmokeAntigravityUnresolvedRealmFails` |\n69|| digest-scoped-to-pass | `TestSmokeTamperedRecordRefuses` |\n70|| consistency-admits-fail | `TestSmokeInconsistentFailRefuses` |\n71|| disagreement-admits-same-length | `TestStoreDisagreementQuarantines` |\n72|| quiescence-admits-unsafe-codex | `TestSmokeUnsafeQuiescenceFails` |\n73|| mapping-admits-yolo | `TestSmokePiUnmappedVersionFails` |\n74|| matrix-admits-muse-offpin | `TestResumeMatrixCoversEverySpecRow` |\n75|| harmless-comment-control | SURVIVED as required |\n76|\n77|No production source-text gate exists (the spec-derivation test reads\n78|the pinned authority document, which `specpin` guards), so the\n79|token-preserving-mutant row is not applicable; stated, not skipped.\n80|\n81|## Stated bounds\n82|\n83|- Native-Windows bind rows (codex, claude, gemini, pi) need a Windows\n84|  host — store roots join with the host separator while the proof rule\n85|  is platform-native — and skip loudly on POSIX. Their cells stay\n86|  pinned by the derivation test on every host.\n87|- Quiescence is consumed as valid-and-safe only; binding the proof's\n88|  own provider/version to the tuple belongs to the quiescence owner.\n89|- Record integrity detects tampering and naive/resigned promotion,\n90|  not a forgery that recomputes both the digest and a consistent\n91|  check list (local evidence, no adversary).\n92|\n93|## Story-close items\n94|\n95|- Ownership bindings: 2.4 full 4/4, 5.5 sliver 1/3, 7.7 partial 3/4,\n96|  8 sliver 4/12; 12 new acceptance cases; pin re-pinned.\n97|  `tracecheck`: 113 cases, 29/463 clauses. `-section 2.4` admitted\n98|  alongside 6.2; README figures and pin tests updated deliberately.\n99|- README: new `Native-resume smoke` section (`internal/sessprofile`\n100|  section already existed). LOGBOOK entry added.\n101|- `task-board.config.json` equals HEAD after the trunk refresh; the\n102|  refresh replayed both story checkpoints with signed continuation\n103|  (LOGBOOK order conflicts resolved trunk-first, content preserved).\n104|\n105|## Validation (all observed, post-refresh tree unless noted)\n106|\n107|- `gofmt -l internal`: clean (448 files)\n108|- `go vet ./...` and `GOOS=windows go vet ./...`: pass\n109|- `go build ./...`: pass\n110|- `tracecheck`: pass (113 cases, 29/463)\n111|- `cataloggen -adopted ... -check` (new command 21): pass\n112|- `cigate` pinned gates: pass\n113|- `go test ./... -count=1`: exit 0, 28 ok, 0 fail (pre- and post-refresh)\n114|- `go test -race` (touched 3 + remaining 25): exit 0, all ok\n115|  (pre-refresh run; the refreshed tree carries identical package\n116|  content and all focused suites re-ran green post-refresh)\n117|- `go test ./... -cover`: exit 0; resumesmoke 77.0% statements\n118|\n119|Candidate left UNCOMMITTED in the Story worktree for handoff snapshot.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
